;. /decode_sources_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition decode_sources
  ;= Decode captured sources
    Accept captured source records, preserving their provenance. Decode by declared format into cohesive native values. Currently supports JSON, Markdown and text; CSV and Parquet require explicit adapters and are refused. No business schema or entity mapping is inferred.
    Publish this procedure independently. Invoke it alone using the retain_result
    writer to inspect its work cells, or select it in another authored flow.

    ;@ /flow/input sources
    ;= sources

    ;@ /flow/step decoded ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/library/decode_sources
    ;@ /flow/bind sources sources
    ;= decoded

    ;@ /flow/result decoded
    ;= Retained result
